<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<task id="090" project="spaarke-side-pane-navigation-history-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>Project wrap-up — README Complete, lessons-learned, /test-diet, success-criteria verification, archive</title>
    <phase>Wrap-up</phase>
    <gate>blocked</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <rigor>MINIMAL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Documentation + reconciliation wrap-up; no production code authored.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Prescriptive close-out checklist with a closed acceptance set.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>Wrap</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Serial project close-out — must run last, after all non-deferred tasks are complete.</parallel-reason>
    <deps>087</deps>
    <tags>wrap-up</tags>
    <estimated-effort>2-4 hours</estimated-effort>
  </metadata>
  <prompt>Close out the project: set the README status to Complete, write notes/lessons-learned.md, invoke /test-diet to reconcile the Jest tests added/modified during the project against the ADR-038 build-vs-maintain philosophy (writing notes/test-diet-report.md), write notes/success-criteria-verification.md mapping each spec Success Criterion to evidence, mark all tasks ✅ in TASK-INDEX, and archive. Do NOT run wrap-up if any non-deferred task is incomplete — report instead.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer performing project close-out per root CLAUDE.md §7 + the project-close test-diet gate. Follow ADRs strictly.</role>
  <goal>A closed-out project: README status = Complete; notes/lessons-learned.md + notes/test-diet-report.md + notes/success-criteria-verification.md written; TASK-INDEX all ✅; archived — with wrap-up refused (report instead) if any non-deferred task is still incomplete.</goal>
  <context>
    <background>Per root CLAUDE.md §7 (task completion &amp; transition) + the project-close test-diet gate (task-execute Step 11 invokes /test-diet before marking the project complete) + plan.md Wrap-up task 090. This project's tests are Jest (frontend); /test-diet applies the ADR-038 build-vs-maintain philosophy to them.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="modify">projects/spaarke-side-pane-navigation-history-r1/README.md</file>
