  </outputs>
  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Given close-out runs, when it completes, then the README status is Complete.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Given close-out runs, when it completes, then lessons-learned.md, test-diet-report.md, and success-criteria-verification.md all exist.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Given close-out runs, when TASK-INDEX is inspected, then all tasks are ✅.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Negative: given any non-deferred task is incomplete, when wrap-up is attempted, then it does NOT run and the incomplete task(s) are reported.</criterion>
